	"VersionName": "1.0.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Actor Phasing",
	"Description": "WoW-style actor phasing for multiplayer games: volume-gated phase membership, replication-level visibility, cross-phase collision and interaction filtering, and idle-phase notifications. Works on the standard replication driver out of the box, with optional adapter modules for Replication Graph and Iris. No engine changes.",
	"Category": "Networking",
	"CreatedBy": "Artisan Gameworks Inc.",
